clang driver: add the Minix toolchain (ld.lld, MINIX crt files, libc++/libc++abi/libunwind),
ported from the MINIX clang 3.6 toolchain. On i386 constructors stay in .ctors, because the
MINIX i386 start files have no .init_array support.

